{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "715d6e6698a71c6324a92f0259a710aca61922ceaffea974f0dd34b914d36f4c", "ja": "うーん……。うう～ん……。", "zh": "嗯……唔唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "293710a7800aa6b48ce6466cf2e51881294a64c9b346703e031401040514bc06", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。\nどうしました？　悩んでいるみたいですけど。", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。\n怎么了？看起来你好像在烦恼什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "be4a7c5066de9048a72e38077df4ce6dd1ab1945184bc5bfa335feb07bfc4c89", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　えへへ。\n悩んでいる、というほどでもないんですけど～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！嘿嘿。\n倒也没到烦恼的程度啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "82f7c57b7783579fafc512e41b1238dd5aaa74e8a1fd1db105dad4e3128cd641", "ja": "私は、何のために生まれてきたんでしょう？", "zh": "我究竟是为了什么才来到这个世上的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "dc42cd082ffd1072bdd65bbf61c4b56bd7b943732d6734eee1eedb4daf1e99c9", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、何のために……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生是为了什么呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "d49207917ded0573b5b4cb6275239e8c86ebe56c72d319ab05ec0b4708c8af32", "ja": "ああっ！　きっと{$P$}さんは、\nアイドルのみんなと出会うため、ですよね！", "zh": "啊！{$P$}先生一定是为了和偶像们相遇，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "445ee5480df70bad7c528cc0d56b7cc3b43b4782d2bd890f20ba995f4c35a7b1", "ja": "すごいなぁ。さすが{$P$}さんです！\nありがとうございます♪", "zh": "真厉害啊。不愧是{$P$}先生！\n谢谢您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c4a753e3d083c801d48b3efba415061c410872ac6cbc633fc4100d1c58bfee4d", "ja": "い、いえ、どういたしまし……て？", "zh": "不、不用客气……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "2a4664d52436ec3513be1a43ec273bc6f7776f7fed315b263240060d9dbc45f2", "ja": "そういえば、今日は社長さんも、\n{$P$}さんをお呼びでしたよ！", "zh": "说起来，今天社长也邀请了{$P$}先生哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "0618532d8ca314345442df649b4890b7c99f38ea9a3bbda025d74481ef07ea88", "ja": "はっ。もしかしたら、{$P$}さんは\n社長さんと出会うために……！", "zh": "啊。难道说，{$P$}先生是为了和社长先生相遇……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6645f2e2a8a5c08a5ef7224239cacecc2f07d9ce29646e43ebf4d6bfaf2a19b5", "ja": "それはどうでしょう。\nとにかく、行ってみますね！", "zh": "那可就不一定了。\n总之，我先去看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "17c27d52969228282a1fe401b01bb71862a3ef8dc2934fbf17e8e3611af68eb1", "ja": "あっ。はーい、行ってらっしゃ～い！\n私も劇場事務員として、精いっぱい、生きていきます♪", "zh": "啊。好～的，路上小心～！\n我也会作为剧场事务员，努力活出精彩的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "09925ddc3c8bd30d4f9fd6d9bc8b7e3899380e37f560b511eacde43a37105a3d", "ja": "社長、失礼します。お呼びだと聞いて……\nうん？　この曲は……！", "zh": "社长，打扰了。听说您找我……\n嗯？这首曲子是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "b058857655477d889bb02e6b1987bec40a16b5e38f83eb72bcdeae9d328e38a9", "ja": "……。\nあの……社長？　音無さん？", "zh": "……。\n那个……社长？音无小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "bb6d0be8a016ec8ae22d79c1a797ed8a624a9e9d35c52692791630e15f2d2634", "ja": "はっ！？　お、おおっ、君か！　いやあ、\nすまない、つい曲に聴き入ってしまってね。", "zh": "啊！？　哦、哦，是你啊！　哎呀，\n抱歉，我一不小心听歌听入迷了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "11d611db9c24298490dd3314a987e6739079def4c422864e56341af6fe9486d9", "ja": "私もつい、色々と想像してしまって……。\nお疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "我也不由得想了很多……辛苦了，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1bb72edf1e6c831cf5e9d0d5ee8c73bf9985ae62e4fc08c259725d1264c84b9b", "ja": "お疲れさまです、音無さん。\nところで社長。この曲は、もしかして？", "zh": "辛苦了，音无小姐。对了，社长，这首歌该不会是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "4e50075ffc5e0be557e4070645d076637341d9048d0e8e70396b05cc95b6b4cf", "ja": "そう、君が発注していた曲だよ！　デモが届いたから、\n先に聴かせてもらっていたんだが……。", "zh": "对，就是你之前委托制作的那首歌！试听版送到了，所以我就先听了一下，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "db43492b3033d731bb14c7ad7ca0226a893e68d41aeb28818fe9702ec6fa2e5c", "ja": "なんでしょう、この疾走感！　この強さ、この情熱！\nなぜか、なぜか泣けて来ちゃいますっ！　うううっ！", "zh": "这是什么样的疾驰感啊！这份力量，这份热情！\n不知为什么，不知为什么眼泪都要掉下来了！呜呜呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "04bdf5d80145552fe306ef066604389657fbfb72a4f71dbddd11f973486bca3d", "ja": "よかった……どうやら期待以上の曲に、\n仕上げてもらえたみたいですね。", "zh": "太好了……看来对方完成了一首\n超出预期的曲子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "35271abe837823fbd21d11f39c3a8f0cbc9cf4b306d52cd2726e21e45aad0602", "ja": "しかし、歌い手を選びそうな曲でもあるようだが……\nいや。このまま最後まで、君に託そう。", "zh": "不过，这首歌似乎也很挑演唱者……  \n不，就这样一直到最后，交给你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "8c76e908da262de6d866830bc3ed5800c59c92bc78d35797f6a461f379e6d87e", "ja": "この情熱的な曲に負けないような、\n情熱的なプロデュース、期待しているよ！", "zh": "我期待着你拿出不输给这首热情歌曲的热情制作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "26ee8c9630fb870792cece8929a79115e2b529482a8ff52292178c0eb22cbc40", "ja": "ん？　君？", "zh": "嗯？你？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_2002_p", "source_sha256": "3c706cd37cccffb5239458be60df6cc08beaf88e958bb4a30af93bccd0369565", "ja": "はっ！？　す、すみません、\nつい聴き入ってしまって……任せてください！", "zh": "哈！？对、对不起，我一不小心听入迷了……交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_2003_101kot", "source_sha256": "84ab95704a7e23c362297039be94dd7bccccb0990176182ec28bf02c08f63cea", "ja": "ちなみに……誰に歌ってもらうつもりなのか、\nもう決まってるんですか？", "zh": "顺便问一下……您已经决定好要让谁来唱了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_2004_president", "source_sha256": "2b269033596447640f3810a917e82a0dc012ca1c72b93ec17c0cefaf55694b9b", "ja": "おっと、ずるいよ音無君！　私は聞くのをガマンしたと\nいうのに！　……ちなみに、誰なんだい？", "zh": "哎呀，太狡猾了，音无！我明明忍住没问的\n\n……顺便问一句，你说的是谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_intro_2005_p", "source_sha256": "35869a9934131f4435cd97cdeba70a00f1af10e9378ebc41b31873813d9a1b11", "ja": "はい、それは……。", "zh": "是的，那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
